    <h2>Why only two departments for now?</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: 10px; color: rgba(34,48,58,0.7); font-size: 0.95rem;">Coco Explore started as a French-language project, and the vast majority of its ~9,300 listings are still French-only. We're translating one department at a time, starting with the French Riviera — the Var, then the Alpes-Maritimes — a popular spot for international visitors travelling with dogs. More departments will follow.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 10px; color: rgba(34,48,58,0.7); font-size: 0.95rem;">In the meantime, the rest of the site — all 101 departments — is in French. Most browsers (Chrome, Safari, Edge) can translate those pages automatically if you'd like to browse further.</p>
